 .-----------------------------.
 | Fluffy Net Application Form |
 `-----------------------------'

 Fluffy Net is one great and fastly growing World network. Join today!

 Please mail all applications to your nearest Fluffy Net BBS or the
 Regional Fluffy Net BBS of the country you are in, from the nodelist.


 .------------------------------.
 | I would like my BBS to be a: |
